  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>House Rules</h1>
    <p>What every tenant agrees to when they move in. These keep shared homes clean, quiet, and respectful for everyone.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="criteria-item">
    <span class="num">1</span>
    <div><h2>Kitchen</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Wash dishes immediately after use</li>
        <li>Wipe down counters, stovetop, fridge, and appliances after each use</li>
        <li>Use cutting boards — never cut directly on countertops</li>
        <li>Use the sink strainer; dump food particles in the garbage</li>
        <li>No leftover food in the fridge after a week</li>
        <li>Respect roommates' assigned kitchen space</li>
        <li>Use the range fan and open windows when cooking heavy meals</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="criteria-item">
    <span class="num">2</span>
    <div><h2>Trash & Recycling</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Tenants alternate weeks for trash/recycling and cleaning duties</li>
        <li>Trash/recycling day is Friday morning</li>
        <li>Keep outdoor areas clean</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="criteria-item">
    <span class="num">3</span>
    <div><h2>Bathroom</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep the bathroom clean and tidy after use</li>
        <li>Tenants alternate weeks for bathroom cleaning</li>
        <li>Be mindful of others' privacy and time during peak hours</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="criteria-item">
    <span class="num">4</span>
    <div><h2>Laundry</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Remove your laundry promptly so machines are free for others</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="criteria-item">
    <span class="num">5</span>
    <div><h2>Common Areas</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep shared spaces neat and presentable</li>
        <li>No sleeping overnight in the living room</li>
        <li>No gaming in living rooms</li>
        <li>Don't monopolize common areas for extended personal use</li>
        <li>Common and outdoor areas may not be used for storage</li>
        <li>No decorative changes to common areas</li>
        <li>Limit guests' use of common areas</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="criteria-item">
    <span class="num">6</span>
    <div><h2>Bedrooms</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No food or drinks left in bedrooms</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="criteria-item">
    <span class="num">7</span>
    <div><h2>Safety & Security</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Lock doors and turn off lights/electronics when leaving the house</li>
        <li>Report maintenance issues promptly</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="criteria-item">
    <span class="num">8</span>
    <div><h2>General Conduct — applies to all properties</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No smoking, indoors or outdoors</li>
        <li>No pets</li>
        <li>No parties or events</li>
        <li>Quiet hours: 11:00 PM – 6:30 AM</li>
        <li>No overnight guests without advance permission</li>
        <li>Follow the assigned cleaning/trash schedule</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="note-card">
    <strong>Private living spaces</strong>
    Units with a private, self-contained entrance follow only the general conduct and safety rules above — there's no shared kitchen/bathroom rotation since the space isn't shared.
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Why We Publish This</h2>
    <p>Every tenant agrees to the same standard, so expectations are clear from day one — no surprises after move-in. Rules exist to keep the home clean, quiet, and respectful for everyone living there.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about how these apply to a specific property, email us at <a href="mailto:mitsecurestay@gmail.com">mitsecurestay@gmail.com</a>.</p>
